# Unverified third-party builds - DO NOT COMMIT.
# A copy of the addon passed along by an individual has no provenance and must
# not enter the evidence tree. Only builds downloaded directly by the rights
# holder from a distribution platform - CurseForge, or Wago Addons since the
# CurseForge listing was removed on 2026-08-20 - and recorded in
# evidence/PROVENANCE.md with a SHA-256 belong there. The tracked
# GRIP-EMS-v*.zip files are those; these patterns match only the unversioned
# filename a hand-passed copy arrives under.
GRIP-EMS.zip
**/GRIP-EMS.zip
GRIP-EMS-unverified*
**/unverified/

